  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Information Platform for Nutrition ( NIPN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NIPN initiative is divided into two 2 closely interweaved components: i) a Global Support Facility (GSF) that will provide technical assistance (TA) to support the NIPN at global level, to be operational in 2015, lasting for the whole duration of the intervention;    and ii) the establishment of the NIPN themselves in five countries, based on expressions of interest from EU Delegations and supported by the Support Facility. The present action document covers the second component only, as t</narrative>
  </description>
